            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Hàng Gạo Đại Việt",
            "review_text": "Rufat M\n1 contribution\n0\nGreat location\nJul 2025 • Friends\nGreat spot right in the heart of Ho Chi Minh City! We stumbled upon this place while walking around District 1 and were so glad we did. The location is perfect—easy to find and close to everything. The menu has a great selection of Vietnamese dishes and some fusion options too. We tried the pho, fresh spring rolls, and grilled pork—all delicious. Portions are generous and prices are reasonable. The staff were super friendly and helpful, even with our limited Vietnamese. Perfect for a casual lunch or dinner. Definitely recommend if you’re in the area!\nRead more\nWritten July 24, 2025",
